      "answer": "Among the North America West Event Nexus accounts, the following are dealing with taxonomy/search semantics problems: Arcadia Cloudworks, BlueHarbor Logistics, CedarWind Renewables, HelioFab Systems, Pacific Health Network, and Pioneer Freight Solutions. These customers report issues such as search relevance degradation, low-relevance or missing results, misfiring runbook triggers, and schema or index mapping problems after taxonomy updates [art_90991e25335f, art_8b0063fbb3cb, art_10f7e8b72e09, art_9345d5653840, art_4eccfd9dcf29, art_3ba29fe1e026].\n\nThe following North America West Event Nexus accounts are dealing with duplicate-action problems related to workflow deduplication drift during cross-system handoffs and post-acquisition systems consolidation: Helix Assemblies Inc., LedgerBright Analytics, LedgerPeak Software, MedLogix Distribution, Peregrine Logistics Group, and Pioneer Grid Retail LLC. These customers report duplicate incidents, repeated remediation runs, idempotency key mismatches, and paging storms after acquisition integrations or system consolidations [art_0ac4efa5a0ff, art_8478ccd5b200, art_2f780acc1f96, art_87b096c2c2d3, art_0927b1cbb7f4, art_f64972a66eeb].\n\nIt is not explicitly stated whether any accounts have both taxonomy/search semantics problems and duplicate-action problems simultaneously or exclusively one type. Also, the full list of all 12 North America West Event Nexus accounts is not explicitly enumerated in the evidence, so it is unclear if any other accounts beyond those identified are in the cohort or their problem classification [art_90991e25335f, art_8b0063fbb3cb, art_10f7e8b72e09, art_9345d5653840, art_4eccfd9dcf29, art_3ba29fe1e026, art_0ac4efa5a0ff, art_8478ccd5b200, art_2f780acc1f96, art_87b096c2c2d3, art_0927b1cbb7f4, art_f64972a66eeb].",
